  "validation_rules": [
    "Strict UTF-8 JSON, duplicate keys and NaN/Infinity refused, exact numeric/boolean types, closed schemas throughout; metadata raw bytes<=4194304 each and container nesting<=64.",
    "SourceRecord strings are nonempty bounded identities; policy_epoch exact positive int; text_bytes exact positive int; all SHA values lowercase64hex. observed_at fixed UTC syntax. Corpus content_ref safe normalized relative corpus/*.txt path<=1024 UTF-8 bytes. No absolute/traversal/URL path, symlink, special file, undeclared content or source-controlled I/O/import.",
    "Exactly32 unique (source_id,revision_id) rows and32 unique content_ref; current/old source_id may intentionally repeat at distinct revisions. Actual total text bytes<=393216. Check actual bytes/hash and strict UTF-8. Identity transform requires source_sha256=extraction_sha256=text_sha256=actual raw text hash; no normalization.",
    "Exactly8 unique DEV cases,40 unique heldout IDs, eight in each exact stratum; case IDs/source revisions and all oracle references consistent. Query is nonempty UTF-8<=2048 bytes. exact selectors either both null or valid paired source/revision. focused_excerpt is this fixture set task_scope. No evaluator fields in case/request schemas.",
    "Fixed seed20261008, exact E/L/S definitions and frozen later gate values; preserve materialized schedule rows, every heldout ID once, every row arms exactly E/L/S once and profiles W/C once. Generation IDs unique20,4 per stratum and members of heldout inventory. No model-based tuning or runtime result field.",
    "Every positive oracle has nonempty expected_answer and at least one valid exact source/revision/text span; every no-answer has expected_answer=null and spans=[]. Gold developer records cover exactly development IDs, main records exactly heldout IDs. Human-authored expected_answer semantics are frozen reference data, not validator inference.",
    "Spans exact integer nonboolean half-open0<=start<end<=text_bytes, both bounds UTF-8-safe; independently hash exact slice, bind whole text_sha256. Each heldout D span decisive evidence after character12000 with byte offset separately computed. Confusable_revision spans name a current annotated revision; exact_ref gold must agree with explicit paired selector. Superseded bytes remain in corpus projection as annotation, not retrieved/admitted live evidence.",
    "Representation control strictly parses compact source JSON with exact number/title/body fields, actual source SHA and derived body+LF+title bytes/extracted-text SHA; do not relabel source representation SHA or normalize text. This is synthetic calibration only.",
    "Gold/oracle fields/annotations never enter corpus/request projections. corpus_projection preserves manifest row order and exact SourceRecord+decoded original text. request_projections maps all48 case IDs to W/C closed requests; profile is inserted by deterministic test fixture projection, not a native worker call.",
    "Report files is exact36-file fixture inventory mapping safe relative path to actual bytes/SHA, including corpus-manifest.json; input manifest never hashes itself. fixture_manifest_sha256 equals actual raw manifest bytes. Dynamic legitimate calibrated candidates may change byte totals/hashes/revisions while satisfying fixed contract.",
    "Report canonical bytes use json.dumps(sort_keys=True,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2,allow_nan=False)+LF. verify-report recomputes exact complete report from admitted inputs, refuses any mismatch, and emits the same canonical report on success.",
    "No-answer source coverage/explanatory semantics are authored and reviewed, not model-certified. Frozen model queries contain no absent/no-answer/unanswerable cue or artificial Ncase ID. The evaluator-only sentinel may change without affecting corpus/request projections.",
    "All8 development queries take the non-exact route, exact_source_id/exact_ref both null; DEV01-04 have supported calibration facts disjoint from heldout targets, DEV05-08 have explicit evaluator no-answer/empty spans. Do not infer an abstention threshold from exact-ref-only or positive-only development cases."
  ]
